{
 "summary": "Fixed OrderedMultiDict.__eq__ (boltons/dictutils.py) and its vendored copy in boltons/urlutils.py: when comparing against a plain mapping, the dict branch computed other[k] == self[k] but discarded the result, so any dict with matching keys compared equal regardless of values. The comparison result is now checked and returns False on value mismatch, making both OrderedMultiDict and QueryParamDict (which subclasses the dictutils OMD) compare False as soon as a value differs and True only when keys and values match."
}

